  "content": "🚨 NOW HIRING: Senior Procurement Manager – Capital Projects 🚨\n\nNO C2C INQUIRIES! \n\nASAP is looking for an experienced Senior Procurement Manager to support a major capital projects program.\n\n📍 Locations: New York, NY | Raleigh, NC | San Jose, CA | Dallas, TX\n🏢 Hybrid – Local Candidates Only\n⚠️ Candidates must currently live within reasonable driving/commuting distance of the applicable office location listed above.\n\nWe’re looking for someone with 10+ years of relevant experience and a strong background in capital projects procurement, strategic sourcing, contracting, RFx, supplier management, MSAs, and SOWs.\n\n🎓 Bachelor’s degree in Construction, Quantity Surveying, or a related field required\n⭐ Must be a member of RICS, AACE, or another relevant professional body\nIf you have senior-level procurement experience supporting complex capital projects and are local to one of these four markets, I’d love to connect.\n\n👉 Check out the attached job posting for full details and apply if interested. Feel free to message me directly or share this opportunity with someone who may be a great fit!\n\nAllied Staff Augmentation Partners, Inc. ( ASAP, Inc. )\n\n#Hiring #ASAP #SeniorProcurementManager #Procurement #StrategicSourcing #CapitalProjects #ContractManagement #RICS #AACE #NowHiring",
